#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>キャンプ・ブロークングラスのタロン少闘士は、仲間からの要請を受けている。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Talon hat von einem Kameraden in Not irgendwo in der Stadt gehört.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Le sous-lieutenant Talon a reçu un appel à l'aide d'un de ses camarades.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzd014_04238:TEXT_AKTKZD014_04238_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Talon has received word from a comrade in dire straits somewhere in the city."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 派遣団の捜索隊員に<sheet EventItem 2003244 0>を使う
#. de: Die Tinktur auf den verwundeten Soldaten anwenden
#. fr: Utiliser la potion de secours sur le soldat blessé
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzd014_04238:TEXT_AKTKZD014_04238_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Use the proffered tincture on the injured soldier."
msgstr ""

#. ja: タロン少闘士と話す
#. de: Mit Talon sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Talon
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzd014_04238:TEXT_AKTKZD014_04238_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Speak with Talon."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if>、いいところに！<br>たったいま、派遣団の仲間から応援要請が入ったんだ！<br>帝国人の保護を担当している奴なんだが……
#. de: <if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><else><split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>. Uns hat vor wenigen Augenblicken ein recht dringender Hilferuf erreicht. Einer unserer besten Kameraden hat einen Zivilisten ausfindig gemacht und wollte ihn in Sicherheit bringen, doch ihm wurde aufgelauert.
#. fr: <if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></capitalize></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></capitalize></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></capitalize></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, vous tombez bien<nbsp>! Un des nôtres, parti secourir un civil garlemaldais, vient de nous contacter pour nous demander de lui envoyer de l'aide en urgence.
#. speaker: TALON
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><she… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
